  "name": "League Champions & Rift Quality Pack / \u82f1\u96c4\u4e0e\u5ce1\u8c37\u54c1\u8d28\u5347\u7ea7",
  "author": "BoDUD",
  "version": "0.10.14",
  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.14 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and uses the matching official 0.5.1 SDK. Versions 0.10.11 through 0.10.13 are retained as failed portrait-route records: 0.10.11 assumed dynamic card roots were named by champion id, 0.10.12 required an unreachable ChampionInfoUIRunner, and 0.10.13 mistook the post-SetImageScale screenshot size (93-96x110-123) for RenderCommand geometry. The default 0.10.14 Yone-only extension now walks the repeated champion_slot clones, identifies Yone from the populated LabelRunner name or ImageRunner source, hides only that slot's battle icon and shows the existing source-direct 85x93 full-body texture. A final-render fallback matches only Yone actor NinePatch commands at the real 85x93 logical size with one-pixel tolerance, replaces the texture and full texture rectangle, clears all borders, enables nearest sampling, and preserves x/y/w/h. The 90x122 BP grid and RenderCommand::Sprite battle actors cannot match. It does not enable the broader legacy MatchUIRunner, ClientDatabase, BP, server or other-champion rewrite; that full extension remains explicitly opt-in. V6 keeps the official 3502x88 battle canvas, 13 animation tags, rectangles, labels and timings; Q/W/R gameplay, effects, icons and audio remain unchanged, as does the saved-season floor introduced in 0.10.5. A save first created on 0.10.5 or later remains valid. Spirit Cleave still performs one stateless 80-degree, 42000-range GameCtx cone scan with no process-global ledger, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles one shield tier for zero through five champions hit; Mod API 0.8 still requires fixed 0.5-second cast and 8-second cooldown. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op saved-data compatibility only so old embedded trees do not crash after BP. Automated source and build checks do not constitute live visual acceptance; the 0.10.14 card route remains pending in-game user verification.",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-21",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.5.1"
    }
  ]
}
